# Why: The official raw source includes address-level fields and is downloaded reproducibly by the script.
data/raw/
# Why: The full cleaned file is generated by the pipeline; publish only a small safe sample later if needed.
data/processed/*.csv
# Why: Local connection strings contain credentials and must never be committed.
.env
# Why: The SQLite database is a generated binary artifact rebuilt from the cleaned data and SQL schema.
database/*.db
# Why: Python bytecode is local runtime output, not project source code.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
# Why: Editor and operating-system files add no portfolio value.
.DS_Store
.vscode/
